  lede: 'Claude writes the pages, and you can correct them. Select text in the page and you will see the same buttons as in the app. Or pick a tool from the list and the demo will show you how it works.',
  toolsH: 'Tools', tried: (n, k) => `Tried: ${n} of ${k}`, guide: 'Press the glowing button.',
